<h1>Cyber-Psychos AOD</h1>

"The Magazine of Mental Aberrations"
<p>
From Jasmine Sailing: Cyber-Psychos AOD provides a dark and sardonic
view of the world by publishing fiction, music reviews, interviews,
and real life profiles, to show how deeply bizarre our society really is.
Contributors include folks as diverse as Uncle River, who has a Ph.D. in
the Psychology of the Unconscious, to the cutting edge fictioneers like
Sue Storm and Don Webb.  Artists range from Gordon Klock to H. E. Fassl 
and interviews cover a wide territory from Vampire Rodents to Brian Hodge. 
Profiles can be about anybody. We want to show that the "alternate world" 
is lot stranger than mainstream people think it is, and much much larger 
than their world in all senses.  We don't merely list references and 
resources, we delve deeply into the psychologies and philosophies of 
those behind the arts.
